  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Capacity Building for International Food Safety Standard Development and Implementation in ASEAN Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to protect the health of the consumers and ensure fair practices in the food trade within ASEAN countries as well as with other countries including Japan. The project also aims to establish a stronger relationship between ASEAN countries and the donor, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Japan.</narrative>
  </description>
